      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "To Little Le:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "你好！",
      "traditional": "你好！",
      "pinyin": "nǐ hǎo",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Hello!"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "中国的国庆节快到了，我们学校10月1日到7日放假。",
      "traditional": "中國的國慶節快到了，我們學校10月1日到7日放假。",
      "pinyin": "zhōng guó de guó qìng jié kuài dào le wǒ men xué xiào 1 yuè 1 rì dào 1 rì fàng jià",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "你来南京玩儿，好吗？我们可以一起去新街口和秦淮河，还可以去吃南京小吃。",
      "traditional": "你來南京玩兒，好嗎？我們可以一起去新街口和秦淮河，還可以去吃南京小吃。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ lái nán jīng wán'r hǎo ma wǒ men kě yǐ yì qǐ qù xīn jiē kǒu hé qín huái hé hái kě yǐ qù chī nán jīng xiǎo chī",
      "english": "It’s China’s National Day soon, and our school will be on holiday from the 1st to 7th October."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "You should come to Nanjing. We can go to Xinjiekou and Qinhuai River together, and also go eat Nanjing snacks."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "南京旁边的上海和杭州也很好玩儿。",
      "traditional": "南京旁邊的上海和杭州也很好玩兒。",
      "pinyin": "nán jīng páng biān de shàng hǎi hé háng zhōu yě hěn hǎo wán‘r",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "上海有著名的外滩，杭州有美丽的西湖，你一定会喜欢的。",
      "traditional": "上海有著名的外灘，杭州有美麗的西湖，你一定會喜歡的。",
      "pinyin": "shàng hǎi yǒu zhù míng de wài tān háng zhōu yǒu měi lì de xī hú nǐ yí dìng huì xǐ huan de",
      "english": "Shanghai and Hangzhou are next to Nanjing, and are a lot of fun too."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "There’s the famous Bund in Shanghai, and the beautiful West Lake in Hangzhou. You’ll like them for sure!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "祝一切顺利！",
      "traditional": "祝一切順利！",
      "pinyin": "zhù yí qiè shùn lì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Wish you all the best!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
